=============================================================================

MedOrbits -- Environment Configuration Template

File: .env.example

Local setup: cp .env.example .env

=============================================================================

SECURITY POLICY

- Never commit .env files, credentials, tokens, private keys, or certificates.

- Use independent, cryptographically random secrets in every environment.

- Inject production secrets through the hosting platform’s secret manager.

- Never expose private documents, temporary files, logs, or backups publicly.

- Keep external integrations disabled until they are configured and tested.

- Validate configuration before opening the application port.

- Use isolated databases and credentials for automated tests.

- Never log secrets, authentication cookies, tokens, or private document data.

- An environment variable has no effect unless application code reads it.

- Verify each setting against the deployed code before enabling it.

=============================================================================

01. APPLICATION IDENTITY AND SERVER

=============================================================================

NODE_ENV=development
APP_ENV=development
APP_NAME=MedOrbits
RELEASE_VERSION=1.0.0
DEPLOYMENT_ENVIRONMENT=local

HOST=127.0.0.1
PORT=3000
TRUST_PROXY=0

APP_URL=http://localhost:3000
FRONTEND_URL=http://localhost:3000
PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:3000
API_PREFIX=/api/v1
API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3000/api/v1

APP_TIMEZONE=Asia/Kolkata
APP_LOCALE=en-IN
APP_CURRENCY=INR
PUBLIC_DEFAULT_LOCALE=en-IN
PUBLIC_DEFAULT_CURRENCY=INR
PUBLIC_BRAND_NAME=MedOrbits

APP_SUPPORT_EMAIL=support@medorbits.in
APP_SUPPORT_PHONE_PRIMARY=+916205889064
APP_SUPPORT_PHONE_SECONDARY=+917644987052
APP_SUPPORT_WHATSAPP_PRIMARY=916205889064
APP_SUPPORT_WHATSAPP_SECONDARY=917644987052

Replace example addresses with verified, monitored mailboxes.

APP_CONTACT_EMAIL=contact@example.com
APP_LEGAL_EMAIL=legal@example.com

MAINTENANCE_MODE=false
STARTUP_TIMEOUT_MS=30000
SHUTDOWN_TIMEOUT_MS=10000
REQUEST_TIMEOUT_MS=30000
KEEP_ALIVE_TIMEOUT_MS=5000
MAX_REQUESTS_PER_CONNECTION=1000

=============================================================================

02. CONFIGURATION VALIDATION

=============================================================================

CONFIG_VALIDATION_ENABLED=true
CONFIG_FAIL_ON_UNKNOWN_ENV=false
CONFIG_FAIL_ON_MISSING_REQUIRED=true
CONFIG_REDACT_SECRETS=true

Keep false locally unless a dedicated production validation mode is implemented.

PRODUCTION_CONFIGURATION_STRICT=false

=============================================================================

03. SECURITY AND AUTHENTICATION

=============================================================================

Generate independent secrets:

node -e "console.log(require(‘node:crypto’).randomBytes(48).toString(‘hex’))"

Generate a separate value for every secret.

Do not paste generated production secrets into this committed template.

SESSION_SECRET=replace_with_unique_random_session_secret
JWT_SECRET=replace_with_unique_random_jwt_secret
COOKIE_SECRET=replace_with_unique_random_cookie_secret

JWT_ISSUER=medorbits
JWT_AUDIENCE=medorbits-users
JWT_ALGORITHM=HS256
JWT_ACCESS_TOKEN_TTL=15m
JWT_REFRESH_TOKEN_TTL=7d

BCRYPT_ROUNDS=12
PASSWORD_MIN_LENGTH=12
PASSWORD_RESET_TOKEN_TTL_MINUTES=30
EMAIL_VERIFICATION_TOKEN_TTL_HOURS=24
AUTH_CLOCK_TOLERANCE_SECONDS=30

AUTH_ENABLED=true
REGISTRATION_ENABLED=true
EMAIL_VERIFICATION_REQUIRED=true
PHONE_VERIFICATION_REQUIRED=false
MFA_ENABLED=false
ADMIN_MFA_REQUIRED=true

CSRF_ENABLED=true
HELMET_ENABLED=true
CONTENT_SECURITY_POLICY_ENABLED=true
TLS_REJECT_UNAUTHORIZED=true

COOKIE_NAME=medorbits.sid
COOKIE_HTTP_ONLY=true
COOKIE_SECURE=false
COOKIE_SAME_SITE=lax
COOKIE_DOMAIN=
COOKIE_MAX_AGE_MS=604800000

LOGIN_MAX_FAILED_ATTEMPTS=5
LOGIN_LOCKOUT_MINUTES=15
PASSWORD_RESET_INVALIDATE_SESSIONS=true
LOGOUT_INVALIDATE_REFRESH_TOKENS=true

Production: use HTTPS, COOKIE_SECURE=true and strong secrets.

Use an appropriate password-hashing algorithm and verify its parameters.

Configure proxy trust narrowly; never trust arbitrary forwarded headers.

=============================================================================

04. SESSION STORAGE

=============================================================================

SESSION_STORE=memory
SESSION_TTL_SECONDS=604800
SESSION_ROLLING=false
SESSION_RESAVE=false
SESSION_SAVE_UNINITIALIZED=false

Memory sessions are for local development only.

Production deployments should use a supported shared session store.

