UPLOAD_ALLOWED_MIME_TYPES=application/pdf,image/jpeg,image/png

PRIVATE_DOCUMENTS_ENABLED=true
DOCUMENTS_REQUIRE_AUTHENTICATION=true
DOCUMENTS_REQUIRE_AUTHORIZATION=true
DOCUMENT_DOWNLOAD_AUDIT_ENABLED=true

TEMP_FILE_TTL_HOURS=24
UPLOAD_CLEANUP_ENABLED=true

MALWARE_SCAN_ENABLED=false
CLAMAV_HOST=127.0.0.1
CLAMAV_PORT=3310

S3_ENABLED=false
S3_ENDPOINT=
S3_REGION=ap-south-1
S3_BUCKET=
S3_ACCESS_KEY_ID=
S3_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=
S3_FORCE_PATH_STYLE=false
S3_PUBLIC_BASE_URL=

Verify file signatures and content, not only file extensions or MIME headers.

Store uploads outside public static directories.

Authorize every document download against the requesting user’s permissions.

Use private object storage and short-lived signed URLs where appropriate.

