14. RATE LIMITING AND ABUSE PREVENTION

=============================================================================

RATE_LIMIT_ENABLED=true
RATE_LIMIT_WINDOW_MS=900000
RATE_LIMIT_MAX_REQUESTS=100

AUTH_RATE_LIMIT_WINDOW_MS=900000
AUTH_RATE_LIMIT_MAX_REQUESTS=10

PASSWORD_RESET_RATE_LIMIT_MAX_REQUESTS=5
EMAIL_VERIFICATION_RATE_LIMIT_MAX_REQUESTS=10

UPLOAD_RATE_LIMIT_WINDOW_MS=900000
UPLOAD_RATE_LIMIT_MAX_REQUESTS=20

Use distributed rate limiting for multi-instance deployments.

Apply additional controls to OTP requests, login attempts and expensive APIs.

=============================================================================

15. LOGGING, AUDITING AND MONITORING

=============================================================================

LOG_LEVEL=info
LOG_FORMAT=json
LOG_TO_CONSOLE=true
LOG_TO_FILE=false
LOG_DIRECTORY=storage/logs

HTTP_LOGGING_ENABLED=true
HTTP_LOG_FORMAT=combined
LOG_REDACT_SENSITIVE_FIELDS=true

AUDIT_LOG_ENABLED=true
AUDIT_LOG_RETENTION_DAYS=365

ERROR_TRACKING_ENABLED=false
SENTRY_DSN=
SENTRY_ENVIRONMENT=development
SENTRY_TRACES_SAMPLE_RATE=0

HEALTH_CHECK_ENABLED=true
HEALTH_CHECK_EXPOSE_DETAILS=false
READINESS_CHECK_ENABLED=true

Redact authorization headers, cookies, passwords, tokens and payment secrets.

Keep liveness checks separate from dependency-sensitive readiness checks.

Restrict detailed diagnostic endpoints to authorized operators.

