Prefer a one-time, controlled administrative setup command.

Never ship default administrator credentials or expose bootstrap routes publicly.

=============================================================================

20. PRIVACY, CONSENT AND ANALYTICS

=============================================================================

PRIVACY_CONTROLS_ENABLED=true
COOKIE_CONSENT_ENABLED=true

ANALYTICS_ENABLED=false
MARKETING_TRACKING_ENABLED=false
ANALYTICS_PROVIDER=
GOOGLE_ANALYTICS_ID=

Define retention, deletion, access and consent policies for personal data.

Retention periods must match actual legal, contractual and business requirements.

=============================================================================

21. OUTBOUND HTTP AND WEBHOOK SECURITY

=============================================================================

HTTP_CLIENT_TIMEOUT_MS=15000
EXTERNAL_API_MAX_RETRIES=2
EXTERNAL_API_RETRY_DELAY_MS=1000

WEBHOOK_SIGNATURE_REQUIRED=true
WEBHOOK_MAX_CLOCK_SKEW_SECONDS=300

Prevent server-side request forgery by validating destinations and blocking

unauthorized internal, loopback and link-local targets where appropriate.

=============================================================================

22. BACKUPS AND RECOVERY

=============================================================================

BACKUP_ENABLED=false
BACKUP_PROVIDER=
BACKUP_STORAGE_PATH=storage/backups
BACKUP_RETENTION_DAYS=30
BACKUP_ENCRYPTION_REQUIRED=true

RESTORE_TEST_REQUIRED=true
DISASTER_RECOVERY_CONTACT=

Backups must be private, encrypted and access-controlled.

Test restoration periodically; a successful backup job alone is not proof

that the application can be recovered.

