E2E_REGISTRATION_EMAIL=
E2E_REGISTRATION_PASSWORD=
E2E_VERIFICATION_URL=
E2E_PROTECTED_DOCUMENT_URL=

Use disposable test accounts and isolated test services.

Never reuse production credentials or production customer data.

=============================================================================

24. DEPLOYMENT AND OPERATIONS

=============================================================================

DEPLOYMENT_REGION=
INSTANCE_ID=
DRAIN_REQUESTS_ON_SHUTDOWN=true
GRACEFUL_SHUTDOWN_ENABLED=true

Configure instance identifiers, deployment region and drain behavior only

when the application and hosting platform support them.

PRODUCTION CHECKLIST

- Use HTTPS and secure cookies.

- Configure trusted proxy addresses explicitly.

- Use least-privilege database credentials and TLS where required.

- Use a shared session and rate-limit store for multiple instances.

- Validate required settings before listening on the application port.

- Keep private documents outside publicly served directories.

- Verify payment signatures and make financial operations idempotent.

- Restrict administrative access and audit privileged actions.

- Test database and document backup restoration.

- Keep dependencies patched and review security advisories.

- Confirm every enabled integration is configured and monitored.

This template documents configuration; it does not implement these controls.

=============================================================================